  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Online Bureau\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Nov 16, 2026 at 07:45 AM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p><a href=\"/tag/hyderabad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hyderabad</a>: <a href=\"/tag/aster+dm+quality+care\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Aster DM Quality Care</a> Limited is set to open a 300-bed <a href=\"/tag/multispecialty+hospital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">multispecialty hospital</a> at Kondapur in Hyderabad in March 2027.The healthcare major said the upcoming facility was developed with an investment of Rs 500 crore and spread across 3 lakh sq. ft.The facility will feature 100 critical care beds, 10 modular operating theatres and luxury suites, along with advanced diagnostic and treatment technologies, including an advanced Cath Lab, CT, MRI, ECMO, IVUS, EBUS and ERCP.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>It will also provide 24/7 emergency care, strengthening access to critical and specialised medical services in the region.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>With the addition of the new facility, the Group's total bed capacity in Hyderabad will exceed 1,700 beds.Dr. Azad Moopen, Executive Chairman, Aster DM Quality Care Limited, said, “Our planned investment of approximately ₹4,000 crore over two years reflects our long-term commitment to strengthening <a href=\"/tag/healthcare+infrastructure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">healthcare infrastructure</a> across India. We aim to add 4,000–4,400 beds, taking our network capacity beyond 15,000 beds through brownfield expansions, selective greenfield projects and strategic acquisitions. Telangana and Andhra Pradesh remain important markets for us, and we see significant opportunities to further expand our presence across the region.”</p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Nov 16, 2026 at 07:45 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Nov 16, 2026 at 07:45 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            